**[Medium] Sanitizer keyword list is incomplete — array/object constraints still slip through and will hit the same 400 this fix targets.**

Nice fix, and the non-mutating recursive walk + dedicated `TestSanitizeAnthropicSchema` are exactly right. But the keyword set only covers numeric and string constraints; Anthropic structured outputs also reject **array and object constraints**, which are not stripped here:

- `minItems`, `maxItems`, `uniqueItems` (array)
- `minProperties`, `maxProperties` (object)

